<title>FRANCE: French official reserves 318.94 bln Ffr end-April.</title>
<headline>French official reserves 318.94 bln Ffr end-April.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France and finance ministry gave the following breakdown of offical gold and foreign exchange reserves (in billions of francs)</p>
<p>					 April	March</p>
<p> Total reserves		   318.939    310.802</p>
<p> Gold				 159.521    159.521</p>
<p> Ecu				   54.628     51.078</p>
<p> Foreign Exchange		  85.940     81.354</p>
<p> Credits with IMF		  18.850     18.849</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
